# Build context is the workspace root, so this keeps ~1GB of node_modules and
# build output out of the daemon transfer. Each image installs its own deps.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local state that must never be baked into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
api/data

.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store

# Nothing here affects a build.
README.md
**/*.md
!api/assets/README.md
